@step Import the quarter's movements so there is an expense to classify.
@setup aeat app ledger import --file fixtures/movimientos-2026-1t.csv --provider csv
@step Classify the expense with the VAT breakdown from the invoice and the source of its VAT deduction.
aeat app ledger classify 1703f840 --classification BUSINESS --category-id material_oficina --taxable-base 500.00 --iva-rate 0.21 --iva-amount 105.00 --deduction-kind domestic_current
@step Confirm the taxable base and VAT fields were recorded.
@result aeat --format json app ledger view 1703f840
@expect result.transaction.taxable_base == "500"
@expect result.transaction.iva_amount == "105"
